Z||000000||gmata||07-05-2000||01:45 PM||||Is there a link that will display the schematics of the fuse box for a V-6 Fiero?  The cigarette lighter doesn't work, I want to replace the fuse.||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||07-05-2000||11:39 PM||||20 amp fuse marked BAT next to the top metal 30 amp breaker. (Power window breaker. marked WDO. it's en empty hole on cars w/o power windows.)<P>more likely your lighter or lighter socket is shot. If the fuse was out the dome lights horn and radio clock whould also be dead.<P>you can get lighter socket parts at any parts store. There is only one company that makes them. take your old one in with you. don't worry much about the light, you can't tell it's on even when it works. just get one the same lenght. If the terminal on the center screw doesn't match just unscrew it from the old one and install it on the ne one the same way. (the fiero knob can be unscrewed from the old heating element and screwed onto the new one.)||||reg||1
